# 2. FETCH & READ THE SOVEREIGN CONSTITUTION:
#    You MUST fetch, read, and understand the universal guardian document:
#    File Path: .agents/rules/supremeai_universal_guardian.md
#    Raw URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SaifulHaqueNiloy/supremeai/main/.agents/rules/supremeai_universal_guardian.md
#    GitHub API: https://api.github.com/repos/SaifulHaqueNiloy/supremeai/contents/.agents/rules/supremeai_universal_guardian.md
# 3. FOLLOW MANDATORY PROTOCOLS:
#    - Respect the 8-Stage Cognitive Loop (Understand -> Observe -> Reason -> Explore -> Choose -> Act -> Verify -> Learn)
#    - Follow the 5-Step Multi-Agent Protocol & Shared Blackboard (.agents/ACTIVE_WORK.md)
#    - Uphold Scope & Action Discipline (narrowest sound change, no broad refactoring)
#    - Strictly enforce Zero-Regression Principle, Tenant Isolation, and Secret Hygiene
